The file prs.jsonl contains excerpts of the titles, descriptions and file lists of pull requests from two open
source projects, both under the MIT License. Email addresses and @mentions are removed and descriptions are
cut at 1,500 characters. Each item's id names the repository and the pull request number (vuejs-core-1234 is
https://github.com/vuejs/core/pull/1234).

